            <div class="info-header">AI GESTURE ENGINE v2.0</div>
            <div class="info-item">
                <div class="info-cmd">✋ FULL OPEN HAND</div>
                <div class="info-desc" data-en="Open palm: Swipe cards / Scroll detail page" data-cn="全掌张开：顺滑推拉卡片 / 详情页滚动">Open palm: Swipe cards / Scroll detail page</div>
            </div>
